"""Stock pod parts a pod template exports when it doesn't author its own: the engine glow (header
slots 69/70) and the cable (10/11), as Anakin's pod (Podd 2) has them, in file units. The game
reshapes both every frame (PoddAnimateVariousThings 0x471760: the glow is scaled by the racer's
glow size and stretched with speed, and its material color and UV offset animated; the cable is
stretched from cockpit to engine and, up close, rebuilt into the game's own tube, FUN_00481c30 /
dinput_hook/renderer_hook.cpp generate_cable_tube), so only the material is worth authoring.
No bpy, so tests can read it."""

